OL,5,G2300 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,6,     FIn Hartlepool, the heli-medics
OL,7,     Ftreat a man who's been hit by a
OL,8,     Ftrain. Cyclist Trevor suffers
OL,9,     Fserious injuries after a
OL,10,     Fcollision. And in Cumbria, a biker
OL,11,     Fneeds emergency surgery.
OL,12,G0005 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FIn Yorkshire, Neil needs urgent
OL,14,     Fattention after falling from his
OL,15,     Fmotorbike. And in the Lakes,
OL,16,     Fmedics scramble to the banks of
OL,17,     FUllswater when a walker goes into
OL,18,     Fcardiac arrest.
